Interview line:
"argocd cluster add registers a target Kubernetes cluster with Argo CD. Argo CD stores the target cluster's connection and authentication configuration in a Secret in the Argo CD namespace. Argo CD uses that Secret to communicate with and deploy applications to the target cluster."
